{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659762",
      "title": "Not All Content Must Go Into Components",
      "sourceHash": "96438334bf51312123ce86564850becc2232df6f23ef3ded35d7052c133027fb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 1.86,
          "en": "So let's get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.86,
          "end": 3.9,
          "en": "working on that tic-tac-toe game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 3.9,
          "end": 7.41,
          "en": "And as you'll see throughout the rest of this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.41,
          "end": 10.23,
          "en": "even though the game might not look too complex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.23,
          "end": 13.35,
          "en": "there actually are many important patterns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.35,
          "end": 17.55,
          "en": "and concepts we'll explore whilst building this game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.55,
          "end": 20.55,
          "en": "Now I wanna start simple though, and I wanna start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 24.33,
          "en": "by adding a nice little header at the top of this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.33,
          "end": 28.29,
          "en": "Basically just an image and a title below that image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 32.46,
          "en": "And for that, in our code here, we can of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.46,
          "end": 36.6,
          "en": "go to this app.jsx file, which contains this app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.6,
          "end": 39.96,
          "en": "which is that main component that is being rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.96,
          "end": 42.723,
          "en": "into the root of our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 45.84,
          "en": "And in this app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.84,
          "end": 48.9,
          "en": "where I currently just have this placeholder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.9,
          "end": 53.55,
          "en": "we could output a header with the built-in header element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.55,
          "end": 57.33,
          "en": "the built-in header component, that contains an image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.33,
          "end": 60.51,
          "en": "with some source and some alt text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.51,
          "end": 62.37,
          "en": "And then below that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.37,
          "end": 67.37,
          "en": "an H1 tag where we can say Tic-Tac-Toe, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.34,
          "end": 72.39,
          "en": "But this is not what I'm going to do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.39,
          "end": 75.51,
          "en": "Instead, I'm going to grab this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.51,
          "end": 78.42,
          "en": "and just output a paragraph here for now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.42,
          "end": 80.31,
          "en": "where I say coming soon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.31,
          "end": 82.773,
          "en": "because we're going to work on this here soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.63,
          "end": 88.371,
          "en": "And I'll instead go to the index.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.371,
          "end": 91.62,
          "en": "because in this file we have this div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.62,
          "end": 94.97999999999999,
          "en": "which is going to get controlled by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.97999999999999,
          "end": 96.84,
          "en": "as you learned before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.84,
          "end": 101.55,
          "en": "Because in index.jsx, we are in the end selecting that div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.55,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "with the ID root to then render the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 106.65,
          "en": "in that div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.65,
          "end": 110.75999999999999,
          "en": "But what's really important to understand is that of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.75999999999999,
          "end": 114.47999999999999,
          "en": "this index.html file is in the end the file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.47999999999999,
          "end": 118.71000000000001,
          "en": "that's going to get served to the visitors of your website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.71000000000001,
          "end": 122.94,
          "en": "Therefore, of course, when working with React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.94,
          "end": 126.489,
          "en": "you can still add more markup to that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.489,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "if you need more markup in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 133.29,
          "en": "If you got some markup that could be put into a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.29,
          "end": 137.19,
          "en": "but that really doesn't have to be inside of a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.19,
          "end": 140.49,
          "en": "because it might not depend on props or any state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 140.49,
          "end": 141.84,
          "en": "that might change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.84,
          "end": 146.19,
          "en": "And therefore you could put this header markup right here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.19,
          "end": 150.333,
          "en": "into this index.html file above this div here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.47,
          "end": 154.5,
          "en": "And I'm highlighting this here because when working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.5,
          "end": 157.489,
          "en": "with React, it's too easy to forget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.489,
          "end": 160.98,
          "en": "that you can do things like that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.98,
          "end": 165,
          "en": "that you don't have to put everything into your component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 165,
          "end": 168.36,
          "en": "Of course, most of your web application's markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.36,
          "end": 171.03,
          "en": "is going to go into your components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.03,
          "end": 174.18,
          "en": "and all of your web application's logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.18,
          "end": 175.71,
          "en": "is going to go in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 178.14,
          "en": "But if you have some static markups,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.14,
          "end": 180.57,
          "en": "some static data like this header here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.57,
          "end": 182.94,
          "en": "which does not depend on any data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 182.94,
          "end": 185.25,
          "en": "and which does not need to change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.25,
          "end": 189.333,
          "en": "you can also put it right into that index.html file here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.62,
          "end": 194.01,
          "en": "And here in this starting project, which I prepared for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.01,
          "end": 196.35,
          "en": "this is definitely what I want to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 196.35,
          "end": 200.31,
          "en": "Because here in this project I also have this public folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.31,
          "end": 203.04,
          "en": "which stores a couple of images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.04,
          "end": 207.36,
          "en": "A couple of images which we can use here in our application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 207.36,
          "end": 211.17000000000002,
          "en": "in our code, because all the files that are stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.17000000000002,
          "end": 214.92000000000002,
          "en": "in the public folder will always be available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.92000000000002,
          "end": 216.99,
          "en": "to your website visitors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.99,
          "end": 219.21,
          "en": "And you can easily reference those files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.21,
          "end": 221.94,
          "en": "in the public folder from inside your markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.94,
          "end": 226.62,
          "en": "no matter if it's in a component or in the index.html file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.62,
          "end": 230.37,
          "en": "as we have it here, by simply specifying the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 230.37,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "of the file you want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 234.78,
          "en": "Here, for example, game-logo.png",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.78,
          "end": 237.603,
          "en": "to reference this image here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 238.68,
          "end": 239.88,
          "en": "Because all these files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.88,
          "end": 242.61,
          "en": "in the public folder will basically be served",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.61,
          "end": 247.11,
          "en": "alongside the index.html file to your website visitors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.11,
          "end": 249.84,
          "en": "That's why you can simply reference them by name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.84,
          "end": 252.63,
          "en": "and you don't have to build a path here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.63,
          "end": 255.93,
          "en": "A public/game-logo.png would be wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 255.93,
          "end": 260.16,
          "en": "because those files will automatically be surfaced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 260.16,
          "end": 263.76,
          "en": "to the root of your web application when being served",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 263.76,
          "end": 265.233,
          "en": "to your website visitors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 266.37,
          "end": 267.843,
          "en": "Now, for the alt text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 268.828,
          "end": 273.24,
          "en": "I'll say hand drawn tic tac toe game board",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 273.24,
          "end": 276.453,
          "en": "because that's what can be seen on this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 277.35,
          "end": 279.39,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 279.39,
          "end": 282.3,
          "en": "and we reload and we make sure that we're scrolled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 282.3,
          "end": 283.89,
          "en": "up all the way to the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 283.89,
          "end": 286.62,
          "en": "we should see this image and this title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 286.62,
          "end": 288.54,
          "en": "And it looks the way it looks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 288.54,
          "end": 290.34000000000003,
          "en": "because of some styling rules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 290.34000000000003,
          "end": 293.58,
          "en": "that are set up in that index.css file, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 293.58,
          "end": 295.8,
          "en": "And definitely feel free to tweak those.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 295.8,
          "end": 297.99,
          "en": "But with that, we got this header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.99,
          "end": 301.29,
          "en": "outside of our React component for the reasons mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 301.29,
          "end": 303.54,
          "en": "But with that, we're now of course going to dive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 303.54,
          "end": 305.099,
          "en": "into the React components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 305.099,
          "end": 309.003,
          "en": "because we're now going to work on the actual game logic.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}